和你同事 Ruchir 开会讨论时，用口语化、逻辑清晰的英文表达会非常高效。你可以参考以下几句口头沟通的表达：
1. 核心意思总结（口语开门见山）
> "To clarify what we need from your side: I’ve filled out the template based on the fields from our monthly extracts. However, there are some columns that I couldn't trace directly to our reporting DB."
> 
2. 展开解释技术细节（讲清楚原因）
> "Some of these columns come from the BO (Business Objects) reports, but they aren't raw fields directly stored in the reporting database—they are calculated or processed in the backend.
> So, I need your help to review and confirm how these specific fields should be mapped or calculated in the DB."
> 
3. 开会时可以直接照着说的完整的表达（建议逐句说）：
> "Hi Ruchir, let me quickly explain what we need to confirm on your end.
> As you know, we provide them with monthly extracts, so I filled out the spreadsheet based on those fields. However, I couldn't directly locate some of the columns in our reporting database.
> Some of these columns appear in the BO reports, but they seem to be processed or computed in the backend rather than existing directly as standard DB fields.
> That's why I need you to double-check those specific 'to be confirmed' columns and clarify their underlying database logic or source."
> 
💡 重点关键词提炼（便于你随时口头串联）：
 * Monthly extracts：每月提取的数据
 * Filled out the template / spreadsheet：填了表格
 * Trace back to the reporting DB：追溯到 reporting 数据库
 * BO reports (Business Objects reports)：BO 报表
 * Calculated / Processed in the backend：后台加工/计算过的
 * Raw fields：原始字段


